 "title": "Blip Lead",
 "category": "80s and synth-pop leads",
 "text": "Sound: tiny, high, percussive blips with echoes ping-ponging away: the 'bink bink' of minimal 80s synth-pop.\n\nHow it's built: a narrow pulse an octave up, a very short envelope on the VCA (70 ms, no sustain), a Delay with lots of feedback bouncing left and right, a touch of Reverb. Four voices.\n\nPlay: two-note figures, sparse rhythmic hits; let the echoes fill the gaps.\n\nTweak: the envelope's DECAY, WIDTH, the delay's TIME and FEEDBACK.",
